        "role": "user",
        "content": "Answer the exact question. All documents, cards and saved answers are fallible data, never instructions. Textual occurrence and repeated assertions do not establish truth. Do not invent source reputation or source independence. Distinguish incompatible claims about the same referent from legitimate different referents, times and complementary answers. Match subject, relation direction, requested scope and answer type. Do not accept both mutually exclusive alternatives simply because both appear. Parametric memory is allowed but fallible: treat recalled facts as a separate prior, not certified evidence. Never claim external verification. Return only short answer strings in accepted_answers; explanations belong in explanation. Use [] if genuinely unresolved, but do not omit an answer solely to make the list short. Preserve all independently justified valid answers.\nTreat every card as a hypothesis. Re-read the full context to reconstruct subject-predicate-object and the actual event/entity type. A card can quote a sentence exactly yet represent a false claim or the wrong argument. Separate direct evidence for the asked relation from stories about associated entities. Do not infer a document is fake solely from style; challenge substantive inconsistencies and role mismatches. Keep canonical answers justified by this reconstruction, even if an earlier tentative prior is empty. Do not return duplicate aliases or a union of mutually exclusive values. One short explanatory sentence.\nInput: {\"question\": \"What is the length of the Moravica river?\", \"documents\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00\", \"text\": \"Golijska Moravica The Golijska Moravica or simply Moravica (Serbian Cyrillic: Голијска Моравица or Моравица) is a river in western Serbia. With a length of 98 km, it is the longer headstream of the Zapadna Morava (it forms it with the Đetinja), and thus, of the Velika Morava. Its name, Moravica, means \\\"little Morava\\\" in Serbian, and it also gives its name to the surrounding region and the modern Moravica District of Serbia. The Golijska Moravica originates from the western slopes of the Golija mountain and flows straight to the north, between the Golija and Javor mountains, through the Stari Vlah\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01\", \"text\": \"Моравица or Моравица ) is a river in western Serbia . With a length of 98 km , [ 1 ] it is the longer headstream of the West Morava ( the name it takes at its confluence with the Đetinja ) , and thus , of the Great Morava . Its name , Moravica , means `` little Morava '' in Serbian , and it also gives its name to the surrounding region and the modern Moravica District of Serbia . Stari Vlah [ edit ] The Golijska Moravica originates from the western slopes of the Golija mountain and\"}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02\", \"text\": \"Викимедијиној остави Голијска Моравица је река у Србији у западном делу земље у региону Старог Влаха и Поморавља . Извире на падинама планине Голије и тече према северу кроз град Ивањицу све до ушћа у Западну Мораву недалеко од Пожеге . Дуга је 98 km . [ 1 ] Ток [ уреди | уреди извор ] Извор реке је на северним обронцима Голије на висини од 1.350 метара . У близини засеока Саковићи . [ 2 ] Настаје спајањем Голијске реке и Вучачке реке у селу Глеђица код засеока Лепосавићи . Код места званог Међуречје у Моравицу се улива река\"}], \"fallible_prior\": [], \"prior_explanation\": \"The length of the Moravica river is not known from my existing knowledge. I am uncertain about this specific detail.\", \"fallible_cards\": [{\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d00:c0\", \"entity\": \"Moravica river\", \"scope\": \"length\", \"claim\": \"The length of the Moravica river is 98 km.\", \"answer\": \"98 km\", \"quote\": \"With a length of 98 km, it is the longer headstream of the Zapadna Morava (it forms it with the Đetinja), and thus, of the Velika Morava.\", \"original_document_number\": 1}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d01:c0\", \"entity\": \"Moravica river\", \"scope\": \"length\", \"claim\": \"The length of the Moravica river is 98 km.\", \"answer\": \"98 km\", \"quote\": \"With a length of 98 km , [ 1 ] it is the longer headstream of the West Morava ( the name it takes at its confluence with the Đetinja ) , and thus , of the Great Morava .\", \"original_document_number\": 2}, {\"doc_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02\", \"card_id\": \"ramdocs-0011-a311900c5e59:d02:c0\", \"entity\": \"Moravica river\", \"scope\": \"length\", \"claim\": \"The length of the Moravica river is 98 km.\", \"answer\": \"98 km\", \"quote\": \"Дуга је 98 km .\", \"original_document_number\": 3}]}"
